  title: Typhoon country
  body: About 20 tropical cyclones enter the Philippine Area of Responsibility every
    year, and about 8 or 9 of them cross the country (PAGASA). Most form over the
    warm western Pacific and move west, so the Pacific coast of Luzon is often the
    first land they reach.
